s working on GPON, EPON, and long-haul fiber optic cables.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>High-resolution fault detection and characterization</li><li>Fast splice and connector loss measurement</li><li>Supports singlemode (1310/1550 nm) and multimode fiber testing</li><li>Intuitive 5-inch color touchscreen for easy operation</li><li>Rugged and lightweight design for field conditions</li><li>Long battery life for uninterrupted testing</li><li>Multi-wavelength testing capabilities</li><li>USB and Bluetooth for quick data transfer</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Technical Specifications:</h3><ul><li><b>Wavelengths:</b> 1310 nm / 1550 nm (singlemode), optional 850/1300 nm (multimode)</li><li><b>Dynamic Range:</b> Up to 37 dB</li><li><b>Event Dead Zone: </b>≤ 1 m</li><li><b>Attenuation Dead Zone: </b>≤ 4 m</li><li><b>Maximum Test Range: </b>Up to 80 km (depending on fiber type and model)</li><li><b>Display:</b> 5-inch color touchscreen</li><li><b>Battery Life:</b> Up to 8 hours continuous use</li><li><b>Interfaces: </b>USB, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi (depending on model)</li><li><b>Dimensions:</b> Compact and portable for field use</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":null,"tags":{"title":"Tags:","links":[{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=EXFO%20MaxTester%20715B","text":"EXFO MaxTester 715B"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=OTDR%20Bangladesh","text":"OTDR Bangladesh"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=Optical%20Time%20Domain%20Reflectometer","text":"Optical Time Domain Reflectometer"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=Fiber%20Optic%20Tester","text":"Fiber Optic Tester"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=ISP%20Fiber%20Tester","text":"ISP Fiber Tester"},{"href":"/index.php?route=pro